@page "/system-status"

<PageTitle>System status</PageTitle>

<section class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS</p>
    <h1>System status</h1>
    <p>
        The application health endpoint is available at <code>/api/health</code>.
        The local Neo4j Bolt reachability probe is available at
        <a href="/api/setup/neo4j-connection" target="_blank">/api/setup/neo4j-connection</a>,
        and the local PostgreSQL reachability probe is available at
        <a href="/api/setup/postgres-connection" target="_blank">/api/setup/postgres-connection</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">These probes verify that the configured local ports accept TCP connections. Database credential validation arrives with the first persistence slice.</div>
</section>
